This program requires third party software that is not included with the standard gcc distribution. 

Before compiling this project make sure the following is installed on your system:

- GLEW development package.
- SFML development package.
- GLM: development package.

g++ *.cpp *.c -lGL -lGLU -lGLEW -lsfml-window -lsfml-graphics -lsfml-system -o PointSimulationViewer

